# to redistribute in this repo.
/app/icons/Azure_Public_Service_Icons/Azure_Icons_FAQ.pdf
/app/icons/Azure_Public_Service_Icons/Microsoft_Terms_of_Use.pdf

# Internal AI-agent build-phase runbook (how WE built this app, phase by phase,
